gainst low-health targets."},{"name":"Attrition Orbs","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c2092fae6ae58ca77a7f9b4434e688ef.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power."},{"name":"Dynamic Sway Reduction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/36091de4dd029fb6e6ab95dbc612ff05.png","desc":"Improves accuracy and stability while continuously holding down the trigger."},{"name":"Ambitious Assassin","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1f93b49c7f10b1be70083f913a3c5d63.png","desc":"Overflows the magazine based on the number of rapid kills before reloading."},{"name":"Enlightened Action","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/cee13d00e65346dacc05562c80f537da.png","desc":"Dealing damage improves reload speed and handling."},{"name":"Hip-Fire Grip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b481f0ed53a3ae0b31a370d115a06860.png","desc":"Increases accuracy, stability, and precision hit targeting when firing from the hip."},{"name":"Slideshot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d41765e3db3a77da5cce27888c52d87.png","desc":"Sliding partially reloads this weapon's magazine and temporarily boosts range and stability."},{"name":"Threat Detector","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9611bdbc48aff898193fd5f705c7cf30.png","desc":"Increased reload, stability, and handling when enemies are in close proximity."},{"name":"Pulse Monitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/64642b7455e88ffde77be53ce7cb7c05.png","desc":"Automatically reloads the magazine and improves weapon handling when wounded—even when this weapon is stowed."},{"name":"Auto-Loading Holster","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e4262099a1c2cea78b48a6680c5248c9.png","desc":"The holstered weapon is automatically reloaded after a short period of time."},{"name":"Pugilist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/93bb6bb34fb0616805ba2a7181ab386c.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon generate melee energy. \nDealing melee damage briefly improves this weapon's handling."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Target Lock","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/72be46e05195a95ae1307a684f68456b.png","desc":"Damage increases the longer this weapon remains on a target."},{"name":"Onslaught","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7e07db21ba2b35751507256e46230616.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon increase its rate of fire."},{"name":"All-Star","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/719abc9d2ce56aa4daffd87152d4d97d.png","desc":"Collecting ammo loads this weapon from reserves and enhances its damage and reload speed for a duration.\n\nCollecting Heavy ammo grants more time."},{"name":"Collective Action","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/901c6420954a4e60fc8a521960f556a8.png","desc":"Collecting an Elemental pickup or destroying a Tangle grants this weapon a stacking period of increased damage. Throwing a Tangle provides additional time.\n\nElemental pickups include [Solar]Firesprites, [Void]Void Breaches, [Arc]Ionic Traces, [Stasis]Stasis Shards, and [Strand]Strand Tangles."},{"name":"Kinetic Tremors","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/300c343e6c33651a74d8a3fe81536146.png","desc":"Sustained kinetic damage to a target emits a shockwave that damages any nearby targets."},{"name":"Ancillary Ordinance","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9565cff650175f7f2c083af28db2dc60.png","desc":"Rapid elemental final blows and final blows on targets affected by elemental debuffs periodically prepare a homing micro-missile, which is launched from your target after this weapon's next final blow. Multiple missiles can be prepared."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Elemental Capacitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e455d94dcafdab7a0d5a850712908020.png","desc":"Increased stats based on the currently equipped Super.\n• [Solar] increases your reload speed.\n• [Arc] increases handling.\n• [Void] increases stability.\n• [Stasis] moderately controls recoil and increases movement speed when aiming down sights.\n• [Strand] increases airborne effectiveness."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Rangefinder","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74270d52bec24f1f5f4c987f5f37fce9.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon increases its effective range and zoom magnification. Increased projectile velocity while aiming Rocket Launchers, Grenade Launchers, and Bows."},{"name":"Swashbuckler","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/42631a4aff4432e794529a5a707eba61.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage from melee kills and kills with this weapon."},{"name":"Rampage","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8976ead57430e4f5f8af1b3005de4f83.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon temporarily grant increased damage. Stacks 3x."},{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Eyes Up","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5f9ab259d07106b6e2d1afdbb7692555.png","desc":"This weapon gains reload speed, range, and slightly increased damage against combatants for a short time when combat begins.\n\nFinal blows extend and enhance this bonus."},{"name":"Rasputin's Arsenal","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/44efbb5de18ddc290c38e12dca746c7b.png","desc":"Breaking a target's shield partially reloads this weapon's magazine."}]}],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[4,20,32,49],[0,13,25,47],[4,19,25,48],[0,13,25,48],[0,13,35,47],[0,13,35,48],[0,19,25,47],[0,19,25,48],[0,19,35,47],[0,19,35,48],[2,19,25,45],[2,19,25,47],[2,19,25,48],[4,19,25,45],[4,19,25,47],[4,20,32,44],[4,20,32,46],[4,20,33,44],[